      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Add Qoder usage provider",
        "body": "## Summary\n- add a Qoder provider backed by the documented `big_model_credits` usage endpoint\n- support `qoder.com` and `qoder.com.cn` with browser cookie import, manual Cookie/cURL/HTTP headers, and token-account overrides\n- handle current response shapes, fractional/member/shared quotas, string or numeric reset dates, cancellation, stale-cache retry precedence, regional fallback, and invalid quota edge cases\n- harden manual credential routing so cookies are never cross-sent across Qoder registrable domains; ambiguous cURL/HTTP input fails closed\n- register Qoder settings, CLI rendering, menu/widget behavior, dashboard links, icon resources, documentation, changelog credit, and regression coverage\n\nCloses #1590.\n\n## Current maintainer proof\nExact head: `e55c83ce4a43fb21b84436cb492b252c5de3db67`\n\nBase used for local proof: `6ab1cbb7daee73b8ad531fbdd420e9aa6eb6d26b`\n\n- `swift test --filter Qoder && swift test --filter ConfigurationDocsProviderIDTests` — passed; Qoder focused suite reported 43 tests, provider-ID docs test passed\n- `make check` — passed; parser hash current, SwiftFormat clean, SwiftLint clean\n- `make test` — passed all 45 shards\n- branch autoreview — clean, no accepted/actionable findings\n- Qoder security/dashboard delta autoreview — clean, no accepted/actionable findings\n- `./Scripts/package_app.sh release` — passed\n- packaged `CodexBar.app/Contents/Info.plist` embeds `CodexGitCommit=e55c83ce4`\n- `codesign --verify --deep --strict --verbose=2 CodexBar.app` — passed\n- isolated synthetic Qoder China manual-cookie proof — passed as expected invalid-session rejection using temp `HOME`, temp `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`, temp `CODEXBAR_CONFIG`, manual-only config, and no browser or Keychain import lane\n\nSynthetic proof limitation: the packaged CLI reports the expected Qoder invalid-session error but does not print the selected endpoint host. China routing for that manual cURL input is covered by the exact-head classifier/source audit and regression tests; the synthetic packaged proof confirms the manual-only path rejects safely without touching real browser or Keychain state.\n\nFinal source audit covered quoted/absolute/escaped `curl` fail-closed behavior; plain cookie values and URL values containing `/curl` still parse as plain cookies; multi-target cURL, Host mismatch, header-file/config, `--location-trusted`, expand options, control-character injection, and appended shell-control protections remain covered by tests.\n\n## Authenticated contributor proof\nEarlier authenticated Qoder China run on contributor head `af6efc3a68456ef2270e97e1819b0d1ab08fef3d`:\n\n```console\n$ GIT_OPTIONAL_LOCKS=0 swift run CodexBarCLI usage --provider qoder --source web --format json --pretty\nBuild of product 'CodexBarCLI' complete!\n[\n  {\n    \"provider\" : \"qoder\",\n    \"source\" : \"Chrome Default / qoder.com.cn\",\n    \"usage\" : {\n      \"identity\" : {\n        \"providerID\" : \"qoder\"\n      },\n      \"primary\" : {\n        \"resetDescription\" : \"0 / 300 credits\",\n        \"resetsAt\" : \"2026-07-09T10:36:42Z\",\n        \"usedPercent\" : 0\n      },\n      \"secondary\" : null,\n      \"tertiary\" : null,\n      \"updatedAt\" : \"2026-07-01T15:12:34Z\"\n    }\n  }\n]\n\n$ rg -n \"Cookie|Authorization|sid=|token|secret|password|Bearer|qoder-account-token|email|user(id|name)?\" /tmp/qoder-exact-head-proof.json\n# no matches\n```\n\nThat authenticated run exposed the China response variant where `nextResetAt` is a numeric timestamp rather than an ISO 8601 string. This PR preserves support for numeric seconds/milliseconds and the existing string forms. The proof above is retained as authenticated contributor evidence; the current exact-head validation is the maintainer proof listed above.\n\n## Screenshots\nAuthenticated contributor run (pre-fix UI; current head removes the duplicate Credits section):\n\n<img width=\"1044\" height=\"1176\" alt=\"Qoder provider settings showing qoder.com.cn cookie source and 0 / 300 credits\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b56e63c1-d719-4b3c-9667-5c467dfc0c1b\" />\n\n<img width=\"622\" height=\"888\" alt=\"CodexBar menu showing Qoder tab with 100% left and 0 / 300 credits\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2910929-72d4-4944-a083-ad05ba18afbb\" />\n",
